From 6633badaefc78a9b2ce7725589b1a2abb26bb282 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 09:10:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix(validation): suppress a row as duplicate only if it
 matches everything the letter prints

Two rows with the same policy and documents but a different hospital, date or name
were treated as duplicates, so the second letter was silently dropped. Rows that match
only on policy and documents now produce both letters and a SIMILAR_ROW warning.
HEADERS_MISMATCH now names the missing, unknown or out-of-order columns.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SvuRq1Eofn4b6USYJT5xnT
